load @term/seed/space/topological
  find topological-space

# A manifold: a topological space that looks locally like flat Euclidean space, stitched together from overlapping
# patches (charts) whose overlaps agree smoothly. It is the setting for curved geometry, the shape spacetime is modelled
# on, locally simple and globally bent. The hyperbolic four-space the mesh tiles is a manifold of constant negative
# curvature. The form carries the underlying topological space; the local-Euclidean charts and their smooth
# compatibility are the axioms.
form manifold
  link space, like topological-space
